WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.082
A shared view depends on other database objects.

00:00:03.082 --> 00:00:09.057
This query uses information schema metadata to show which tables feed each view.

00:00:09.057 --> 00:00:17.107
Dependency awareness matters because changing a base object or shared view can affect several downstream

00:00:17.107 --> 00:00:22.177
consumers. Before making a breaking change, understand the dependency chain.

00:00:22.177 --> 00:00:26.272
Reusable SQL objects create dependencies.

00:00:26.272 --> 00:00:33.082
Before changing a base view, identify which other views, reports, or applications depend on it.

00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:36.472
Good change management includes version awareness, tests,

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:41.662
and communication—not just editing CREATE VIEW until it succeeds.
